Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.09,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Betraying little witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:09.30,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:14.95,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's a perfect name for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:53.00,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1300,775)}#2 "T{\c&H3A8CE0&}h{\c}e {\c&H3A8CE0&}P{\c}r{\c&H3A8CE0&}i{\c}n{\c&H3A8CE0&}c{\c}e{\c&H3A8CE0&}s{\c}s{\c&H3A8CE0&}'{\c}s {\c&H3A8CE0&}C{\c}o{\c&H3A8CE0&}n{\c}f{\c&H3A8CE0&}e{\c}s{\c&H3A8CE0&}s{\c}i{\c&H3A8CE0&}o{\c}n"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:50.67,Main Top,Gasou,0,0,0,,I mean, the Koiwais, \Nthe servants of the Adagaki family,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:53.12,Main Top,Gasou,0,0,0,,are pretty famous for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:57.80,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Wouldn't this be going against \Nyour master's wishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:00.72,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm Adagaki Aki's fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:04.57,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,You're ignoring your master and secretly \Nmeeting with Makabe Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:07.93,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I wonder what they'd say if \Nthey ever found out about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.73,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:12.66,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If you want to snitch on me, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:17.85,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Wow... I guess that didn't hurt at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:19.34,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.41,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, when I said "them," \NI didn't mean Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:26.87,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I was talking about your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.95,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I mean, honestly, your feelings \Nare pretty understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:34.04,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Because you're like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:34.88,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.45,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan's pretty pure, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:41.55,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I'll have no \Nproblem winning her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:46.64,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,But if the families get involved, \Nthings will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:49.52,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,You can't break away from \Nthe status you were born into.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:51.19,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Not even a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:56.98,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I mean, if you could, \Nyou wouldn't come all the way to Paris
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:03:00.41,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,dealing with this warped \Nmaster-servant relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:04.16,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't speak as if you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:08.81,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm only doing what I'm doing \Nbecause you're unworthy of Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:11.80,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I've thought that ever since you \Nappeared at the Adagaki home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.61,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're so conniving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:16.14,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Oh? And how am I conniving, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:19.42,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I very much plan on bringing \Nsome grandchildren into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.67,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:23.52,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're acting like someone who's \Nprecious to Aki-sama and lyi—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.86,Main,Chibi Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you going to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:38.48,Main,Chibi Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't blame me if they \Nfind out about that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:44.97,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:49.33,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,You saying those things just because you \Ndon't like me really won't get through to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:52.96,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,But anyway, your parents are pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:56.75,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,They're wondering what you're doing, \Nskipping out on work like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:59.30,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,You should probably lay low for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:03.02,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,so they don't relieve you \Nof your attendant duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:25.36,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,Show how it's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.22,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:35.61,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,C-Calm down, me! How lame \Nwould I be if I lost my cool here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:38.83,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,In the end, this is just part\N of the Dead or Love plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.69,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I just need to take the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:45.68,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Let's go for a little walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:53.98,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:04.00,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I see. It seems like they're really going for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:07.82,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,It's very clear that you're working hard to \Nlessen the distance between you two, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:10.37,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,This French girl doesn't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:18.64,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What a beautiful city...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:19.75,Italics,Masamune and Aki,0,0,0,,Next...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:21.74,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Why, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:23.21,Italics,Masamune and Aki,0,0,0,,What do we do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:34.75,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be walking \Nside by side with you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:36.82,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Me, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.70,Main,Muriel (Aki),0,0,0,,Next, let's wander around Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:49.99,Main,Muriel (Aki),0,0,0,,There will be anime, games, \Nand manga waiting for us there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:54.68,Main,Muriel (Masamune),0,0,0,,When I'm with you, I could walk \Nto the end of the Mansei Bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.15,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Could you stop awkwardly dubbing over us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:01.92,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Aw, but I thought it was a good idea, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:05.42,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You can let your creativity run free after \Nyou get the basic shape of this drama down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:10.84,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,My hand is sweating so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:14.76,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Crap, crap, crap. \NDid she notice I'm actually nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:19.88,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? The one that wasn't \Nholding her hand is fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.80,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:26.46,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Stop butting in. Take a few more steps back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:28.86,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,A-All right, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:33.64,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess the Cruel Princess is \Ndoing the best she can, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:37.51,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.53,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's continue this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:40.60,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.71,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.22,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.58,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:58.70,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You're shameless, you stupid Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:00.60,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, are you out of gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.52,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I want to end myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.14,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Er, it's not {\i1}that{\i0} big of a deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:09.24,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Anyway, why don't we go get something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:10.84,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:17.23,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Food. Energy. Sugar. Carbohydrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:19.54,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Well, she's not saying no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:28.97,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Took you long enough, Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:32.57,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry. You're okay with mustard \Non your sandwich, ri—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:41.39,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Hey... You think we should\Njust eat these like usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.35,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:46.26,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I mean... Muriel's staring really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:51.99,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:56.80,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Maybe we should do something rom-com-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,She did say to show her how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:00.79,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,But what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:04.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Maybe we should feed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:09.18,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have ulterior motives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:10.73,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,If you have any other ideas...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:13.22,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No, I don't! I don't have any at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.72,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Then, uh, let's go with the feeding thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.22,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:26.44,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Here... Open wide, Makabe-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:30.15,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,H-How nice of you... Adagaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:35.45,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I-It's so hard to eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:42.70,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks for the food...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:55.34,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:57.55,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:09:01.42,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I can't... Why the hell do I have to do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:04.89,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'd rather eat it myself than feed it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:11.58,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry, Muriel, but this is our limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:25.83,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Nope. I can't give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:30.59,Main,Dog owner (Female),0,0,0,,Jeanne!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.74,Main,Dog owner (Female),0,0,0,,Toutes mes excusez, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.96,Main,Dog owner (Male),0,0,0,,Excusez moi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:40.83,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You always did like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:41.43,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:43.68,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Dogs, especially big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:47.40,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Did I ever mention that before? \NWe used to have big dogs, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:49.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Used to? What about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:53.29,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I haven't had any since we lost our last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:56.41,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I couldn't bring myself to get a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:02.51,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I see... So those were the last ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:09.58,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,This is the perfect opportunity, \Nso will you just listen for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:16.08,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Before, I wasn't a big eater or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.51,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,How I ended up like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:23.47,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,and why I can't accept your feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.94,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.44,Flashback,Yoshino's mother (Head Maid),0,0,0,,You mustn't, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.64,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I can't see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:38.97,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother (Head Maid),0,0,0,,We don't want you getting chickenpox, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.82,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, that's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:45.39,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I wanted to have fun playing\Nwith makeup with Yoshino again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:47.29,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Are you really blaming all this on me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:48.96,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,You always do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.58,Flashback,Father,0,0,0,,Just shut up! I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.24,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,You always run away like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:55.90,Flashback,Father,0,0,0,,You're always so selfish! \NJust think for a damn second!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.84,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's had enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:58.84,Flashback Top,Mother,0,0,0,,Why did I ever get married \Nto someone like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:02.30,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Sean! Lancelot! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:06.01,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:09.75,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I guess you're my only friends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:12.58,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,No, that's plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:14.98,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:17.13,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,You can't get away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.69,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,You put us through too much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:22.44,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,M-My family's really rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:26.16,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,You moron. Then treat us to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:28.55,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Sean, get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:34.25,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing \Nin front of my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.10,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:36.39,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:42.82,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:46.32,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm asking you for your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:50.20,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I-I'm... Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:53.52,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,You look awful. Wipe off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.25,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Fank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.96,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Who blows their nose at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.31,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? Should I not have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:05.39,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,S-Sorry... I'll wash it and return it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.95,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't want it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:10.66,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,It's fine! Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:15.02,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,That was how Masamune and I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:18.59,Flashback,Father,0,0,0,,There you are, Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:22.80,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\bord1\c&H7960B2&\3c&H93A2AE&\frx328\fry16\pos(455.333,219.333)}Snow White
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:21.68,Flashback,Father,0,0,0,,Want to go to dinner with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:22.80,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Just the two of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:25.14,Flashback,Father,0,0,0,,Yes, it'll be a little date.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:28.39,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,No. Don't wear that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.04,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:32.70,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Let's go have some clothes made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.53,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,There's a designer \NI always request outfits from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:36.75,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Just the two of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:37.82,Flashback,Mother,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:41.36,Flashback Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,I guess all three of us going isn't an option...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:45.29,Flashback Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,So whoever gets my affection wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:49.28,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-chan, this is to thank \Nyou for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.66,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Chocolate from Patisserie Otafuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:56.06,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,They only make ten of these a day! \NIsn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:58.83,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm honestly tired of stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.63,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.44,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,My mom and dad aren't getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:05.66,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,They only start fighting about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:09.12,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,how much presents cost or how rare \Nthey are when they want to win my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:12.98,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,It's so lame. I'm just sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.10,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:21.24,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,You don't need to cry. \NYou can eat them if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:25.40,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,B-But I feel so bad for you, Aki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:32.30,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I would be really sad if my mom \Nand dad didn't get along...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:36.15,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.83,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,You're so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:40.76,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.55,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,A-Ahi-hyan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:49.93,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,But you're too weak. \NYou need to toughen up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:55.20,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Masamune, I'll train you so you \Nwon't lose to those bullies anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:56.32,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:57.58,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Lancelot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:05.40,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:10.86,Flashback Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't remember the last \Ntime I laughed this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:14.58,Flashback,Gardener,0,0,0,,Okay, look this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:20.54,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Lancelot, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:22.50,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, now you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:27.80,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,G-Good boy... Good boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:35.32,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:40.59,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,With my guidance, Masamune \Ngrew a little stronger every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.59,0:14:43.16,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,and every day became fun for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:46.09,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:50.16,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,Where are you, Tubbymune?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.12,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve bailing \Nafter you called us out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\b0\c&H65829D&\bord0\frz29.11\frx4\fry4\fs14\pos(302,224)}Come to the park\Ntomorrow at 5 PM.\N-Masamune
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:55.37,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:58.33,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:01.10,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:06.12,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Today's the last day you'll ever bully me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:07.76,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I've also left a will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:11.78,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Everything you've done \Nto me will come to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:15.68,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Goodbye, you embarrassments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:16.80,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.86,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:21.55,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.85,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,You tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:24.88,Flashback Top,Boys,0,0,0,,Ow! Dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.58,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,That was a huge success.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.95,Flashback Top,Boys,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:29.78,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,You finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.80,Flashback Top,Boys,0,0,0,,Man, that hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:31.82,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:36.41,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of you guys anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:43.53,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,They should stop bothering you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:46.04,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.20,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I never would've been able \Nto do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:51.26,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I just helped you out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:56.87,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,I want you, at least, to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:58.43,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.50,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,It's hopeless for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:04.40,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,My parents are separating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:06.48,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:10.36,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,H-Huh? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:19.68,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,This time, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:23.14,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep supporting you \Nso you can cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.30,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'll stay by your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:32.46,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So... what happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:37.76,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Nothing. He never showed his face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:38.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:43.22,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I guess he just wanted someone \Nto save him from the bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:47.11,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I just ended up having feelings for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:50.68,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,But... I really did like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:54.32,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,His puffy cheeks, \Nhis tubby tummy... everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.92,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Ever since I cried and started binge eating,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:59.42,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I just couldn't stop overeating, \Nand I'm tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:04.35,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,And I guess Masamune didn't feel \Nbad about disappearing, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:06.84,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,H-How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:09.37,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, he told me himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.37,0:17:10.09,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:12.17,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Gasou Kanetsugu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:15.32,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,He used to be kind like that \Nwhen we were younger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:17.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Masamune is his old nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:21.23,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The Cruel Princess thinks Gasou is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.28,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wait, before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.73,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Everything she said is completely \Ndifferent from my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:31.94,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I don't ever want to feel that sad again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:38.91,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,So... that's why I can't accept \Nyour feelings toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:42.12,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,What is she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.08,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Feel sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:47.93,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,You're the one who chased me away, saying \Nyou could never have feelings for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.08,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,You called me Pig's Foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.65,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's why... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:54.51,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:04.43,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-chan was crying... \NI hope this cheers her up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.89,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,Hey, Tubbymune!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:09.52,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,We need to thank you for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:12.92,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:18.22,Flashback Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Almost... I'm almost at Aki-chan's house...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:26.03,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:27.37,Flashback,Boy C,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:29.52,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,What the hell's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:30.89,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.05,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,They're filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:39.51,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-chan! Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:43.69,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,This loser's trying to get that \Nboss girl to save him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:45.29,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,Talk about pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:48.02,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,No! Aki-chan's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.36,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I promised her I'd stay by her side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:52.70,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,We're going to be friends forever and—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:54.69,Flashback,Yoshino pretending to be Aki,0,0,0,,Shut up, you stupid boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:18:59.52,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-cha—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:01.87,Flashback,Yoshino pretending to be Aki,0,0,0,,I'll never fall in love with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:03.82,Flashback,Yoshino pretending to be Aki,0,0,0,,Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.85,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,Talk about sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.43,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,He just got shot down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:10.29,Flashback,Boys,0,0,0,,She called him Pig's Foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:12.42,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Aki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:16.06,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The Dead or Love plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:18.21,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Making her fall for me, then dumping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.21,0:19:21.00,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Adagaki Aki actually did the \Nexact same thing to me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:25.61,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,So how is she able to look \Nlike the tragic heroine here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:32.63,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Then why did you call me \N"Pig's Foot" and chase me away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:34.11,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Quit acting like the victim!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:37.28,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You deserved everything you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:43.95,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Non! What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:47.61,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Fighting is bad, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.16,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,This is just too cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:55.04,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I thought you'd at least hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:06.41,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Masamune! Aki left! Aren't you \Ngoing to chase after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:09.31,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.86,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But I can't think about anything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:20.91,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Money is important! Money is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:32.54,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Aki-chan? \NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:35.89,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to listen, Ak—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.03,0:20:41.17,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,What the heck happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:52.36,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,What is it, Nii-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:54.98,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,Where the hell are those \Nstupid Japanese kids?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.98,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,I thought they were supposed to \Nteach you the essence of rom-coms!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.72,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,We ran into a bit of trouble, \Nso it's been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.72,0:21:05.66,Italics,Frank,0,0,0,,I'll talk to them again and make them—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.09,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,If you do that, I'll hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:13.41,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Nii-san, I'm going to draw a new manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:16.74,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,One that has a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:21.37,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Makabe-kun! You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:22.40,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:25.38,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,We were so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:27.34,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Where's Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.69,0:21:29.80,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:31.81,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,We sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,got into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&HC6F9FD&\bord0\frx352\fry6\pos(132,91.334)\frz18.76}Message
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&HC6F9FD&\bord0\frx352\fry6\frz18.76\pos(219.333,57.333)}Koiwai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&HC6F9FD&\bord0\frx352\fry6\frz18.76\pos(320,24.667)}Edit
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H6D9184&\3c&HAACFC0&\fs10\an8\frz19.86\pos(189.333,200.667)}Koiwai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H6D9184&\3c&HA0C1B0&\fs10\an8\frz19.86\pos(242.667,320)}Koiwai
